<subpara id="RM000002G5A004X_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D6T00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>The knock control sensor is installed on the cylinder block and detects engine knocking. The knock control sensor contains a sensor that generates voltage when the cylinder block vibrates and deforms due to knocking. When knocking occurs, the engine control computer retards the ignition timing to suppress the knocking.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
